cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Fire Scene Enhancer: real-time image enhancement for extreme fire scenes"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Tiong"
    given-names: "Edwin Kwong Meng"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  C++17 / OpenCV implementation of the master's thesis "Real-Time Image
  Enhancement System for Extreme Fire Scenes" (National Cheng Kung University,
  2026). CPU-only pipeline with fire and smoke masks, dark channel dehazing,
  adaptive gamma and mask-aware CLAHE.
keywords:
  - image enhancement
  - fire scene
  - dehazing
  - CLAHE
  - real-time
  - OpenCV
